Photographs of January 26, 2011, for your review and comments:

Barbeque stonework
Canary palms at top of hill
Coral stone planter outside of bedroom 3: Question for JE from Brice: Do you like the position of the planter?
Grotto boulder wall in progress
Kitchen backsplash installation
Kitchen skylights
Walkways off of kitchen and living room painting in progress
Prep for landscaping behind master suite
Stairs to master suite progress

I am sending the balance of the photographs in a second email.

Respectfully submitted,

Daphne




