Greetings Mr. Epstein,

Attached for your review and comment are photos of the kitchen countertops that were installed this morning.
This is not my report for today, only a sample of some of the photos I took this morning. I wish to make sure
that I am going in the right direction regarding the details you are looking for in the photos I send you going
forward, as well as making sure that you do not have any problems opening or manipulating the photos going
forward. I am on island all day, and after lunch will be going to the grotto and to the boulder entry with Igala.

Respectfully submitted,

Daphne




