Greetings Mr. Epstein,

In response to your directive that the canary should be centered on the opening, Gary advised that it was
necessary to plant the palm far enough away from the master suite so the palm fronds do not interfere with the
roof gutters.

Brian has been advised to place buffers between the floating dock and the pilings.

Photographs of January 31, 2011, for your review and comments:

Landscaping behind master suite progress
Dock pad excavation
Entry way project - the additional boulders and the machine are on site to begin repositioning the boulders into
place tomorrow
Ion's work on the faceplates in the cottages
Master suite foyer sconces installed
Master suite tub room
Stairs to master suite tiling
Outdoor tub
Nanna painting
Handrails

Respectfully submitted,

Daphne




